assistant: Subject: convert cent prices from vendor 2026-10-01 to dollars

Since vendor API version 2026-10-01, `/products` sends prices in cents (Aero 14 is now 119900, not 1199), and the published spec doesn't mention it. `search_products` passed that number straight through as dollars, so agents got prices 100 times too high. The fix in `src/tools/search_products.ts` reads the `vendor-api-version` header and divides the price by 100 when the version is 2026-10-01 or later. Older versions still pass the price through unchanged, so the v1 fixtures give the same output as before. The tool sends the same requests as before, and `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint` and `pnpm test` all pass, including the repro test. `get_product` reads the same `price` field and is probably also 100 times too high on the new version; I didn't change it because it was outside this fix.

